# --- Go ---
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
go.work
go.work.sum

# Compiled test binaries from `go test -c` (the cross-compile / QEMU workflow
# produces these constantly — they are build artifacts, never evidence)
*.test.s390x
*.test.zos

# --- Emulator artifacts (ADR 0001, Track M / Track L) ---
# TK5 and Hercules live OUTSIDE this repo (C:\mvs-tk5 — see the setup runbook).
# These patterns exist so that an accidental copy never lands in git: DASD
# volumes are hundreds of megabytes and mutate on every IPL.
*.cckd
*.cckd64
*.dasd
*.3390
*.3380
*.tape
*.het
*.aws
hercules.log
hercules.rc.log

# Raw emulator console spool. Curated extracts belong in docs/evidence/*.md;
# multi-megabyte raw spool does not.
*.prt
*.punch
spool/

# --- OS / editor ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Claude Code ---
# .claude/ IS tracked on purpose: hooks, agents, and skills are project
# infrastructure and every future session should inherit them. Only the
# personal, machine-local override is ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Scratch ---
scratch/
tmp/
*.bak
